# EVERY BITE HAS A GROUND RING (mechanics pass, slice 1d; FightRules.tell_ring).
# A machine's windup pose is small over the shoulder; a pale ring on the ground
# where the bite will land, for as long as it winds up, reads from above, from
# behind and under a lock alike. A runner is let come in and bite, and each
# frame is taken while its tell is up. A harvester's wide bite shows a wide one.
# Run at a fixed rate, so a frame costs the world no time and the ring is still
# up when it is taken:
#   TOUR_FIXED_FPS=60 tools/tour.sh tours/bite_ring.tour --seed=4 --hour=11 --weather=clear:0 --give=knife:1 --held=knife
coast calm
zoom 7
wait 0.6
spawn runner
await tell 8
wait 0.15
shot 01-from-above-the-ring-under-its-bite with mob:runner

coast calm
tap shoulder
await shoulder 3
spawn runner
await tell 8
wait 0.15
shot 02-over-the-shoulder-the-ring-reads-from-behind with shoulder,mob:runner

coast calm
spawn runner
wait 0.3
hold target
await target 5
await shoulder_locked 3
await tell 8
wait 0.15
shot 03-locked-on-the-ring-under-its-bite with shoulder_locked,mob:runner
release target

coast calm
tap shoulder
await top_view 3
spawn harvester
wait 0.5
walkto part 3
press swing 0.1
await tell 8
wait 0.2
shot 04-a-harvester-s-wide-bite-a-wide-ring with mob:harvester
